OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment blocks export of       
OL,4,Alandmark Welsh painting in bid to save 
OL,5,Ait                                     
OL,7,FA painting believed to be the earliest 
OL,8,Fknown British country estate landscape 
OL,9,Fhas been barred from export to give a  
OL,10,Fgallery or institution the chance to   
OL,11,Facquire it, the UK government has said.
OL,13,FThe bird's-eye view landscape artwork  
OL,14,Fof Llannerch Park, in Denbighshire,    
OL,15,Fnorth Wales, was completed in 1662 and 
OL,16,Fdepicts the house and Italian-style    
OL,17,Fgardens.                               
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
