OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment blocks export of       
OL,4,Alandmark Welsh painting in bid to save 
OL,5,Ait                                     
OL,7,FIt has been described as an            
OL,8,F"extraordinary window into the         
OL,9,Fdevelopment of gardens" and a heritage 
OL,10,Fexpert said it was "the only surviving 
OL,11,Fevidence of a radical Welsh garden".   
OL,13,FThe piece has now been placed on a     
OL,14,Ftemporary export ban in the hope of    
OL,15,Fkeeping it accessible to the UK public.
